OL,4,CIsraeli air strike kills Hamas         
OL,5,Cinternal security chief in Gaza        
OL,6,GAt least seven Palestinians, including 
OL,7,Ga senior Hamas security official, have 
OL,8,Gbeen killed in Israeli air strikes in  
OL,9,Gthe Gaza Strip, health officials and   
OL,10,Gfirst responders say.                  
OL,12,FNaeem Abu Nahel, the head of Hamas's   
OL,13,Finternal security service, was         
OL,14,Ftargeted in western Gaza City, Gaza's  
OL,15,FHamas-run interior ministry said. The  
OL,16,F50-year-old had only been in the       
OL,17,Fposition since September, when his     
OL,18,Fpredecessor was captured in a raid by  
OL,19,FIsraeli special forces.                
